<title>USA: Mobile America declares 15.0 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Mobile America declares 15.0 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobile America Corp said Tuesday its board has declared a 15 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will be distributed July 11 to shareholders of record June 23, it said.</p>
<p>The company also said it has acquired 54,500 of its shares as part of the 100,000-share buyback program initiated in 1995. It has paid between $9.25 and $12 per share, it said.</p>
</text>
